  "title": "France's Top Court Strikes Down Social Media Ban for Children Under 15",
  "summary": "The French court ruled that a ban on social media access for children under 15 violates freedom of expression and privacy, blocking the ban and setting a precedent for future policies. President Macron vowed to rework the legislation before leaving office.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "France's top court blocked a ban on social media access for children under 15, ruling it infringes on freedom of expression and privacy.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
